        "jsCode": "// AGGREGATOR NODE: Combine all items in the batch into a SINGLE request payload\n// This prevents the HTTP Request node from executing multiple times in parallel\n\nconst noticias = items.map(item => ({\n    text: item.json.prompt_para_api,\n    metadata: item.json.metadata_para_api\n}));\n\nreturn [{\n    json: {\n        payload: {\n            noticias: noticias,\n            callback_url: \"http://n8n:5678/webhook/webhook-callback\"\n        }\n    }\n}];"
